      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS BELLA BABE (1) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Continues to race well, filling the minors at the last three starts, the latest when third (26.43) at this track. Has a good record at this journey. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Deserves a win and gets her chance. AWE PEANUT (2) has a strong record this track and trip including three wins from four starts. Missed the frame latest (25.51) when eighth over 435m at Sale in a Grade 5. Looks well placed here and among the chances. MIGHTY HERCULES (7) finds it hard to break through. Finished in the money last time though when second (26.58) at this track. Solid record at the distance winning 15 races. Can feature again. LUCA SKYWALKER (8) can play a role in the finish without surprising.",
